// C5VRX by Twotoz and the C5VRX contributors: Tripleversity, Sipeed Tang Nano 20K
// (QN88). LCD per Sipeed's rgb_lcd example; the C5s on the 3.3 V header pins the
// LCD leaves free. Pins 15-20 also carry the onboard LEDs (C5 C data: the LEDs
// flicker with the IQ). iq_x = {I sign, I2, I1, Q sign, Q2, Q1}; see ../hwx.h.

IO_LOC "xtal" 4;
IO_PORT "xtal" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULL_MODE=NONE;
